new='''<div class="wide"><div><em>*</em> 选择门店 <small id="store-count">已选0家</small></div><div class="row" style="margin-top:12px"><button type="button" class="link" id="choose-stores">＋选择门店</button><button type="button" class="link" id="import-stores">＋导入门店</button><span class="error" style="font-size:12px">说明：1.门店必须唯一。2.再次导入 / 选择时，将替换原有数据，以最新数据为准。</span></div><input hidden type="file" id="store-file" accept=".csv,text/csv"><div id="store-picker" hidden style="margin-top:16px;padding:16px;border:1px solid var(--p-line);border-radius:4px"><div class="muted">选择执行门店（演示门店）</div><div id="store-options" class="row" style="margin:12px 0"></div><div class="row"><button type="button" id="confirm-stores">确认选择并替换</button><button type="button" id="cancel-stores">取消</button></div></div><div id="store-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>序号</th><th>门店名称 *</th><th>活动日期</th><th>门店地址</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody id="store-rows"><tr><td colspan="5" style="text-align:center;color:var(--p-sub)">暂无数据，请选择或导入门店</td></tr></tbody></table></div><small>导入支持UTF-8 CSV，表头：门店编码、门店名称、门店地址。按门店编码去重。</small></div>'''
